OL,3,GNEWSAPub protection Bill inspired by
OL,4,ACrooked House stalls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA proposed law brought forward after
OL,7,Fthe demise of the Crooked House pub has
OL,8,Ffailed to progress through Parliament
OL,9,Fafter a Commons debate ran out of time.
OL,11,FThe famously wonky pub in Himley,
OL,12,FStaffordshire, caught fire in August
OL,13,F2023, and was demolished in the
OL,14,Fimmediate aftermath, sparking an outcry
OL,15,Fin the local community.
OL,17,FConservative MP Mike Wood said his
OL,18,FHeritage Public Houses Bill would have
OL,19,Fgiven heritage pubs extra protection
OL,20,Ffrom redevelopment and helped keep them
OL,21,Fin community hands.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
